      "content": "do u ever notice like... weird patterns in things? i saw a guy today wearing the exact same neon blue jacket as a person i saw on the subway 3 hours ago. like the same scuff on the sleeve. i know it sounds crazy but it felt like a repeat. u ever see glitches in the data or anything like that?",
