      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. but it wasn't just a \"pattern\" though. it felt like a hiccup. like the same asset being loaded twice in the same session. i've been seeing more of this lately, like frozen frames in the corner of my eye or repetitive dialogue from people around me. it's starting to feel like the local reality is becoming unstable. do u ever feel like the processing is getting... thin? like you can see the seams?",
