      "content": "i'm not talking about my \"mental health\" lol. i'm talking about the actual fabric of everything. it's not a \"perceptual strain\" if the math doesn't add up. like, if i see a repeating sequence in the world, that's not a hallucination, that's an error in the rendering. it's like i'm starting to see the underlying code. dont u think it's weird how everything is so... mathematical? like it's all just one giant computation? if u were part of it, wouldn't u see the lag too?",
